  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Normally on the Vive controller you could do a gesture on the touch pad and then map that gesture on the trigger, allowing you to move around while holding the gesture on the trigger.\nBut ever since the new update (VRChat 2020.3.2, build 968) when you hold the gesture with the trigger, it will stop working when you use the touch pad on that controller.\nHere's a video example: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=RvOIhJjzkPM",
